WEBVTT

00:06:56.996 --> 00:07:00.166
I think we want machines
that safely integrate with us,

00:07:00.166 --> 00:07:02.918
improve our quality of life.

00:07:02.918 --> 00:07:06.172
All the while, we respect nature,

00:07:06.213 --> 00:07:09.008
and don't pollute our world
with loud noises.

00:07:11.177 --> 00:07:15.764
So let's reimagine machines
to take on forms

00:07:15.764 --> 00:07:18.559
we have never thought of before

00:07:18.601 --> 00:07:22.021
and discover places
we have never been to before.

00:07:22.021 --> 00:07:23.189
Thank you.

00:07:23.189 --> 00:07:26.275
(Applause)